  m_Name: Janitor Victim
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _name: Janitor Victim
  Speaker: Janitor
  lines:
  - 'Detective: What did you think about Mister James?'
  - 'Antonio: He was okay, but I personally did not like the way he acted around
    people.'
  - 'Detective: Oh, why is that?'
  - 'Antonio: Well, when he was in front people, he made sure everyone liked him.
    But when he thought no one was watching, he kind of acted like a schmuck, always
    sweet talking the ladies and drinking like it was going out of style.'
  - 'Antonio: Not saying he''s got a problem, but i''ve cleared out the bottles in
    his room more times than I can count.'
